"Cherishing the garbage \nI had all along\nYes it smells stinky\nBut the garbage was never wrong\n\nOutside might had gold in it\nMight contain diamond within\nBut the garbage I had with me\nAlways shined and with a grin\n\nI might bear the stinky inside\nThe garbage is there and it is mine\nNot going to dump or going to burn\nThat's my garbage for ya', like a rising sun"